# docs-site/ is the Mintlify content root, configured via the dashboard toggle
# "docs.json is in a subdirectory". Everything outside this directory is out of
# scope by construction — that is what keeps real-projects/, plans/, prompts/,
# AGENTS.md and the other packages' generated docs off a public site.
#
# What remains is a second layer, not the primary control. Over-broad patterns
# here turn inbound links into reported broken links, so only paths that must
# never ship are listed.
node_modules/
.mintlify/
.astro/
dist/